# 📘 Complementary Angles (पूरक कोण)

### 🔹 परिभाषा (Definition)

जब दो कोणों का योगफल 90° हो तो उन्हें **Complementary Angles** कहते हैं।
👉 उदाहरण: 30° + 60° = 90°

---

## ✨ Trigonometry में Complementary Angles Rules

1. **sin θ = cos (90° – θ)**
2. **cos θ = sin (90° – θ)**
3. **tan θ = cot (90° – θ)**
4. **cot θ = tan (90° – θ)**
5. **sec θ = cosec (90° – θ)**
6. **cosec θ = sec (90° – θ)**

---

## 🔹 Important Values (0°, 30°, 45°, 60°, 90°)

| θ   | sin θ | cos θ | tan θ | cot θ | sec θ | cosec θ |
| --- | ----- | ----- | ----- | ----- | ----- | ------- |
| 0°  | 0     | 1     | 0     | ∞     | 1     | ∞       |
| 30° | 1/2   | √3/2  | 1/√3  | √3    | 2/√3  | 2       |
| 45° | 1/√2  | 1/√2  | 1     | 1     | √2    | √2      |
| 60° | √3/2  | 1/2   | √3    | 1/√3  | 2     | 2/√3    |
| 90° | 1     | 0     | ∞     | 0     | ∞     | 1       |

---

